00:00:14.915 --> 00:00:18.852 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Le Château Dufresne

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:20.187 size:53% position:73% line:53%
a été construit en pleine

00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:21.555 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Première Guerre mondiale

00:00:19.153 --> 00:00:22.756 size:53% position:73% line:53%
par les frères Dufresne,

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:23.924 size:53% position:73% line:53%
