00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:25.125 size:53% position:73% line:53%
établis dans l'actuel quartier

00:00:23.057 --> 00:00:26.293 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Hochelaga-Maisonneuve.

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:27.461 size:53% position:73% line:53%
MANON LAPOINTE, directrice gén.

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:28.662 size:53% position:73% line:53%
conservatrice, Château Dufresne

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:29.830 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ce sont des gens qui ont voulu

00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:30.998 size:53% position:73% line:53%
implanter une bourgeoisie

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:32.199 size:53% position:73% line:53%
francophone dans l'est de

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:33.367 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Montréal, alors que le secteur

00:00:31.298 --> 00:00:34.535 size:53% position:73% line:53%
