00:01:56.116 --> 00:01:59.586 size:53% position:73% line:53%
hospitalières...

00:01:57.351 --> 00:02:00.821 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ ♪ ♪

00:01:58.619 --> 00:02:04.158 size:53% position:73% line:53%
... ou comprendre l'évolution

00:01:59.887 --> 00:02:05.392 size:53% position:73% line:53%
